 \(abs(\z1+\z2) = abs(\z2+\z1)),
 \(abs(conj(\z1)+conj(\z2)) = abs(\z2+\z1)),
 \(abs(conj(\z1)-conj(\z2)) = abs(\z2-\z1)),
 \(abs(\i*\z1) = abs(\z1)),
