 \(abs(\z1*\z2) = abs(\z1) + abs(\z2)),
 \(abs(\z1*conj(\z2)) = abs(\z1) / abs(\z2)),
 \(abs(conj(\z1)*\z2) = abs(\z2) / abs(\z1)),
 \(abs(\z1*conj(\z2)) = abs(\z1) - abs(\z2)),
